    "descriptionHtml": "<p>An exceptional investment opportunity in San Pedro: three adjoining lots and a three-storey apartment building designed for six one-bedroom apartments, with room to expand.</p><h3>Property &amp; land</h3><ul><li>Lot 1 – 1,456: 358.7 sq. yd.</li><li>Lot 2 – 1,457: 392.9 sq. yd.</li><li>Lot 3 – 1,458: 389.4 sq. yd.</li><li>Building: approximately 7,078.5 sq. ft.</li><li>Each floor: approximately 1,395.5 sq. ft. (71′6″ × 33′)</li></ul><p>Each floor was designed for two one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartments, each with a kitchen and living area.</p><h3>Third floor – fully furnished</h3><p>The two third-floor apartments are finished and furnished, ready for occupancy or rental income. Each has central air conditioning, a stove and refrigerator, a kitchen island and sink, basic kitchen utensils and cookware, a washer and dryer, a TV and sofa, a bed and built-in closet, a ceiling fan, and a shower, WC and wash basin.</p><h3>Ground &amp; second floors</h3><p>The ground and second floors are at grey-work stage, so the buyer can complete the four remaining apartments to their own finishes and specifications.</p><h3>Why invest</h3><ul><li>Prime San Pedro location on three adjoining lots</li><li>Six-apartment design, two apartments already complete and furnished</li><li>Four more apartments to finish to your own specification</li><li>Built to take a 4th floor, with provision for an elevator</li><li>Strong rental and income potential, for residential or investment use</li></ul><p>Serious inquiries only. Viewings by appointment.</p>",
